description:
In 2023 Walcha Council undertook investigation works including maintenance hole inspections and

smoke testing to identify sources of infiltration and inflow (I&I) within the Walcha sewer network.

Walcha Council have identified priority manhole remediation locations and seeking to engage a qualified contractor to complete the works.

The Works generally include:

- Remediation of defective maintenance holes identified in the FITT inspection program;

- Remediation of Council-owned defects identified through the smoke testing program;

- Validation of asset condition and ownership;

- Minor excavation, repair and reinstatement works associated with the above; and

- Documentation and reporting to support Council’s asset management system.

These works are to be completed prior to the end financial year 2026-2027.

