Section 1.2.2.2 of the Scope seeks amongst other tasks to undertake or recommend additional modelling where existing data is insufficient. To assist us in scoping the task and resources, can LSC advise:

•	What are the available flood studies and modelling including catchment area covered and events modelled;

•	Confirmation if LSC is expecting a catchment flood model to be developed or reliant on interrogation of existing flooding models.

